# API Gateway Guidelines

## Mục tiêu

Tài liệu này định nghĩa các nguyên tắc và best practices cho việc implement API Gateway trong Cursor Enterprise Framework. Mục tiêu là đảm bảo secure, scalable, và efficient API management.

API Gateway là single entry point cho microservices, cung cấp routing, authentication, và other cross-cutting concerns.

## Nguyên tắc cơ bản

### 1. Gateway Responsibilities

Core gateway functions.

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    API Gateway Responsibilities                      │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                  │
│  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐            │
│  │  Routing   │  │    Auth     │  │ Rate Limit │            │
│  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘            │
│                                                                  │
│  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐            │
│  │   Load     │  │    Cache    │  │    Logs    │            │
│  │  Balance   │  │             │  │             │            │
│  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘            │
│                                                                  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### 2. Route Configuration

API routing setup.

```yaml
# Kong gateway configuration
_format_version: "3.0"
services:
  - name: user-service
    url: http://user-service:3000
    routes:
      - name: user-route
        paths:
          - /api/users
        methods:
          - GET
          - POST
        strip_path: false

  - name: order-service
    url: http://order-service:3000
    routes:
      - name: order-route
        paths:
          - /api/orders
        methods:
          - GET
          - POST
          - PUT
          - DELETE
        strip_path: false

  - name: product-service
    url: http://product-service:3000
    routes:
      - name: product-route
        paths:
          - /api/products
        methods:
          - GET
        strip_path: false

plugins:
  - name: rate-limiting
    config:
      minute: 100
      policy: redis

  - name: cors
    config:
      origins:
        - https://example.com
      methods:
        - GET
        - POST
        - PUT
        - DELETE
      headers:
        - Authorization
      credentials: true
      max_age: 3600
```

### 3. Authentication Integration

Gateway authentication.

```yaml
# JWT authentication plugin
plugins:
  - name: jwt
    config:
      uri_param_names:
        - jwt
      header_names:
        - Authorization
      claims_to_verify:
        - exp
        - nbf
      maximum_expiration: 3600

# Key authentication
plugins:
  - name: key-auth
    config:
      key_names:
        - X-API-Key
      key_in_body: false
      hide_credentials: true

# OAuth 2.0
plugins:
  - name: oauth2
    config:
      scopes:
        - read
        - write
      scopes_grant_type: client_credentials
      mandatoryScopes: true
```

### 4. Rate Limiting Configuration

Gateway rate limiting.

```yaml
# Rate limiting policies
plugins:
  # Global rate limit
  - name: rate-limiting
    config:
      minute: 1000
      hour: 10000
      policy: local

  # Per-consumer rate limit
  - name: rate-limiting
    config:
      minute: 100
      policy: redis
      redis_host: redis
      redis_port: 6379
      fault_tolerant: true
      hide_client_headers: false

# Advanced rate limiting
rate_limit_by:
  consumer: true     # Per API consumer
  header: X-API-Key # Per header value
  ip: true          # Per IP address

# Response headers
limit_by: consumer
limits:
  second: 10
  minute: 100
  hour: 1000
  day: 10000
```

### 5. Caching Strategy

Response caching at gateway.

```yaml
# Cache configuration
plugins:
  - name: proxy-cache
    config:
      response_code:
        - 200
      request_method:
        - GET
        - HEAD
      content_type:
        - application/json
      cache_ttl: 300
      strategy: memory
      memory:
        dictionary_name: kong_cache

  - name: proxy-cache-advanced
    config:
      response_code:
        - 200
      request_method:
        - GET
      content_type:
        - application/json
      cache_ttl: 60
      strategy: redis
      redis_host: redis
      redis_port: 6379

# Cache invalidation
plugins:
  - name: cache-invalidation
    config:
      on_request: true
      strategies:
        - name: redis
          host: redis
          port: 6379
```

### 6. Circuit Breaker

Failure handling.

```yaml
# Circuit breaker configuration
plugins:
  - name: circuit-breaker
    config:
      fault_threshold: 50       # Error percentage to trip
      health_threshold: 20     # Recovery threshold
      timeout: 60              # Probe timeout (seconds)
      request_timeout: 30      # Request timeout (seconds)
      failure_count: 3          # Consecutive failures to trip
      success_count: 3          # Successes to close circuit
      period: 10               # Health check period (seconds)
```

### 7. Logging và Monitoring

Gateway observability.

```yaml
# Access logging
plugins:
  - name: access-log
    config:
      logging_fields:
        - request.method
        - request.url
        - request.headers
        - response.status
        - latency
        - consumer
      log_payloads: false

# Prometheus metrics
plugins:
  - name: prometheus
    config:
      per_consumer: true
      metrics:
        - name: kong_request_latency_ms
          type: histogram
        - name: kong_request_size
          type: counter
        - name: kong_response_size
          type: counter
        - name: kong_upstream_latency_ms
          type: histogram
```

### 8. Load Balancing

Gateway load balancing.

```yaml
# Upstream configuration
upstreams:
  - name: user-service
    algorithm: round-robin
    healthchecks:
      active:
        type: https
        http_path: /health
        healthy:
          interval: 5
          successes: 2
        unhealthy:
          interval: 5
          http_failures: 3
      passive:
        type: http
        healthy:
          successes: 3
        unhealthy:
          http_failures: 3
    targets:
      - target: user-service-1:3000
        weight: 100
      - target: user-service-2:3000
        weight: 100
      - target: user-service-3:3000
        weight: 100
```

